  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "English: Libmem.NET 2.2.0 promotes Windows x86 to official support alongside x64. Delivery: required x86 runtime CI, architecture-aware external-process coverage, separate x64/x86 Runtime ZIPs and checksums, and one multi-architecture NuGet package with architecture-matched managed/native assets. Consumers must explicitly target x64 or x86; AnyCPU and cross-bitness operation remain unsupported. Compatibility: the 2.1.1 Public API and pinned rdbo/libmem revision are preserved. 中文：Libmem.NET 2.2.0 将 Windows x86 提升为与 x64 并列的正式支持架构。交付内容：x86 必选运行时 CI、架构感知的外部进程测试、分别提供 x64/x86 Runtime ZIP 与校验文件，以及一个包含架构匹配托管/原生资产的双架构 NuGet 包。消费者必须显式选择 x64 或 x86；AnyCPU 与跨位数运行仍不支持。兼容性：保持 2.1.1 Public API 与固定 rdbo/libmem revision 不变。 Full notes / 完整说明: https://github.com/CardResearchLab/Libmem.NET/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
